<title>POLAND: MOSTOSTAL-E PLANS CONVERTIBLE BONDS ISSUE.</title>
<headline>MOSTOSTAL-E PLANS CONVERTIBLE BONDS ISSUE.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish construction and trading company Mostostal Export SA shareholders will vote on June 14 on issueing between $30 and $40 million of convertible bonds, the company said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The statement gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
